      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "A useful systematic approach is to categorize the flagged entries by vendor, date range, and the specific amount of the discrepancy. Next, cross-reference these peculiar transactions with the purchasing database to see if any supporting documentation or requisition forms are missing or incomplete. This method will help you pinpoint whether the irregularity stems from a process breakdown, human error, or a recurring purchasing issue.",
