    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "That makes sense. One thing that's bothering me is that the amounts are quite small—usually just a few euros or dollars—so they're easy to miss if you aren't looking for them specifically. They seem to pop up almost randomly too. Is there a way to determine if these are just random clerical errors or if someone is intentionally skimming small amounts through these miscellaneous entries?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
