      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "To differentiate between random error and intentional skimming, you should perform a behavioral analysis of the transaction patterns. Look for a concentration of these small entries around specific times of day or during the processing by particular team members. If the small values consistently cluster just below any internal approval threshold, it suggests a deliberate attempt to evade oversight, rather than simple clerical mistakes.",
